---
title: "Required checks during wl finish"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Waiting for topic checks
  s1: Needs action before target push
  s2: Topic checks passed
  s3: Needs action with the remote's reason
  s4: Waiting for checks on pushed target
  s5: Needs action after target push
  s6: Integrated
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: required topic check fails or workflow cannot start
  s0 --> s2: required topic check passes
  s1 --> s0: finish again after fixing the cause
  s2 --> s3: the remote refuses the push [target unmoved]
  s2 --> s4: push prepared commit to target
  s2 --> s0: the target moved first, so merge and validate again
  s3 --> s0: finish again after fixing the cause
  s4 --> s5: required target check fails or workflow cannot start
  s4 --> s6: required target check passes
